Z||000014||Howard_Sacks||12-09-2001||03:26 PM||||Jelly: The car was well maintained.  That's why I included the oil thing, because everyone who hears asks about maintenance. <P> I'll send you an email offlist, but it's irresponsible to tell people that it's ok to drive these things (stock, not custom rebuilt ones like yours) at the limit (speeds &gt; 110mph) for long periods of time.  Although you may be right about the age thing, because it probably wouldn't be a good idea to drive the stock engine like a european touring car's even when new.<p>[This message has been edited by Howard_Sacks (edited 12-09-2001).]||||reg||13
